  "optionsSupportExpressions": true,
  "notes": [
    "Companion core actions and feedbacks (module id internal), read from companion/lib/Internal/*.ts of Companion v5.1.3 (commit 93ea3fa). Only the most important entries are catalogued: button press/release/rotate, step control, abort (panic), custom, local and page variables, triggers, surface and page control, lockout, wait and logic blocks, instance control and recorder basics.",
    "Internal definitions use label instead of name and declare optionsSupportExpressions per definition; the per-entry value takes precedence over the module default (true). Entries with false do not accept expressions.",
    "Internal option types such as internal:page, internal:variable, internal:custom_variable, internal:surface_serial and expression are recorded as type 'other' with the raw type in rawType.",
    "The location option defaults to '$(this:page)/$(this:row)/$(this:column)' and accepts an expression such as 'this' (shared-lib/lib/ControlLocation.ts:3-12).",
    "Not tested against a running instance; the source of v5.1.3 is the only evidence."
